<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>标准化 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</title><link>https://yousali.com/tags/%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%8C%96/</link><description>Recent content in 标准化 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.148.1</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:21:54 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yousali.com/tags/%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%8C%96/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>在网球场上用红粉笔画厨房，麦当劳兄弟把跑通的厨房搬进新店</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/mcdonalds-speedee-system/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/mcdonalds-speedee-system/</guid><description>1948年麦当劳兄弟在圣贝纳迪诺精简菜单并推行自助窗口与15美分汉堡。几年后为筹备更大的凤凰城加盟店，迪克·麦当劳在网球场用红粉笔排演新厨房。1955年克罗克开出自己体系首店，并于1961年以270万美元收购相关权利。</description></item></channel></rss>